# Linker / build output. bin/ tools (MakeLZSA.exe, premake5.exe, ...) and
# packages/ WebView2 .lib files are already tracked, so unaffected.
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.so
*.a
*.dylib

# Build logs and root-level scratch written by local build / analysis runs
